# Backend Go Edge

Mother rule: `.ai/instructions/backend-go-edge.md`.

Read `MEMORY.md` and `AI_BOARD.md` before editing.

- Keep MQTT callbacks lightweight and channel-based.
- Keep projects as virtual business groups, not MQTT gateway children. Legacy `device` names are historical aliases only.
- Do not implement application-layer historical sync without confirmed board scope.
- API, DTO, schema, SSE/WS, RabbitMQ, or HTTP changes must update `AI_BOARD.md`.
